        "text": "One bellows suction cup (nonlinear bellows) on a tool with a prescribed motion holds a box. motion: 1 hold, 2 vertical bounce, 3 horizontal steps, 4 tilt swing, 5 lateral chirp. Mon draws the cup in 3D and latches a drop; Trans demodulates the lateral chirp.",
